        <!--
        ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
          TOP-DOWN FDD LAYOUT
          ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
          Row 0  y= 80  Root node          w=200 h=60  centre-x=765
          Row 1  y=210  4 × Level-1 nodes  w=160 h=60
          Row 2  y=330  11× Level-2 nodes  w=120 h=45

          Trunk lines:  root→L1 trunk at y=180,  L1→L2 trunk at y=300

          L2 node positions  (w=120, gap=20 within group; group gap=20):
            Dashboard (3): x= 40, 180, 320   centres= 100, 240, 380
            Predict   (3): x=440, 580, 720   centres= 500, 640, 780
            Result    (2): x=860, 990        centres= 920,1050
            About     (3): x=1130,1270,1410  centres=1190,1330,1470

          Group centres (= L1 centre-x):
            Dashboard: (40+440)/2=240   → l1-dashboard x=160, centre=240
            Predict:   (440+840)/2=640  → l1-predict   x=560, centre=640
            Result:    (860+1110)/2=985 → l1-result    x=905, centre=985
            About:    (1130+1530)/2=1330→ l1-about    x=1250,centre=1330

          Root centre: (240+1330)/2=785  → root x=685

          Level row labels placed to the right at x=1560
        ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        -->

        <!-- ═══ LEVEL 0 ═══ -->
